# Spec for tools/riscpkg.py: the LibRaw plug-in, from LumenRaw-<ver>.zip.
Package: LumenRaw
Section: Graphics
Priority: Optional
Licence: Free
Maintainer: Andrew Youll <adyoull@users.noreply.github.com>
Standards-Version: 0.4.0
Environment: arm32, vfpv3
Depends: Lumen, SharedUnixLibrary (>= 1.16), ARMEABISupport
Description: Camera raw files for Lumen (LibRaw)
 Lets Lumen import, show, adjust and export camera raw files (Canon,
 Nikon, Sony, Fujifilm, Olympus, Panasonic, Pentax, DNG and many more)
 with LibRaw 0.22.3: the camera's own preview for thumbnails, developed
 with its white balance and colour for the viewer and exports. It goes
 into Lumen's Plugins directory; Lumen finds it the next time it starts.
Build-Map: !Lumen/Plugins/LibRaw -> Apps/Graphics/!Lumen/Plugins/LibRaw
Build-Notice: The LibRaw plug-in for Lumen, packaged for PackMan from its
 release zip.
 .
 LumenRaw is copyright (C) 2026 Andrew Youll. LibRaw is copyright LibRaw
 LLC and used under the GNU LGPL 2.1, which follows.
Build-Copyright: !Lumen/Plugins/LibRaw/Licence
